===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂yew-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|conjuren}}, from {{der|en|fro|conjurer|}}, from {{der|en|la|coniūrō||I swear together; conspire}}, from {{m|la|con-||with, together}} + {{m|la|iūro||I swear or take an oath}}.

